    {
      "response": {
        "content": "Proposed spec is ready for confirmation: tags (flexible track) -> dwell 0.7 + density 0.3 with bird plausibility (30 m/s, straight-line and constant-speed checks off); wind (stiff, open_meteo) -> vector field shifting tags.density, weight 0; labels watering hole, roost, feeding ground, stopover; score authority-only; routing off.",
